      "text": "<math><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∨</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>",
