  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Option <math><mi>A</mi></math> is true only if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math> is true and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is false which is never possible hence <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a fallacy<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a subset of <math><mi>p</mi></math> hence <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math><mi>p</mi></math> is a tautology hence <math><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a fallacy<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> <math><mi>p</mi></math> is subset of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> hence <math><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is tautology hence <math><mo>~</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math> is a fallacy<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> Option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is the negation of option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> hence <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a tautology",
